        },
        {
          "text": "Ilawaco i ndelo no ni, “Neni, me Were mawan, watieko kuro go ŋey wobothi wan. Me Rwoth ma watieko kuro; weyi wasangala aka wafore i both pere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.9"
            ]
