        },
        {
          "text": "Kole cingi Rwoth lakikwonga Got Zayon, aka lanyono piny Mowab i kabedo pere, paka inyono piny cuŋ i bur woyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
